    },
    {
      "text": "Hello, you've reached VeloFit customer support. My name is Steve. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 203,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769109017266666
    },
    {
      "text": "Hi Steve, I need to make a return on a jersey I bought a couple of weeks ago.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 26144,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769109023533332
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly help you with that. Do you have your order number handy?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 203,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769109028866665
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, it's VF-8675309.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 26144,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769109033866665
    },
    {
      "text": "Great, let me pull that up... Okay, I see the order. And I also see you're a VIP member with us. We really appreciate your loyalty!",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 203,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769109035466665
    },
    {
      "text": "Thanks. So, can I return it?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 26144,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769109044399998
    },
    {
      "text": "Absolutely, **no problem** at all. You are well within the **90 days** we allow for returns.",
